# Without this, whoever clones on Linux or macOS gets whatever line endings the
# Windows checkout happened to produce. Normalise text to LF in the repository;
# working copies still follow each platform's convention.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and large enough that a mangled one would be an annoying thing to
# discover later. Marked explicitly rather than left to content sniffing.
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
